MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6fa5db35ac5d81d49b0eff06f993ad07, type: 3}
  m_Name: SitWithTheDemon
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  paragraphs:
  - paragraph: '"Ah, wise choice, traveler," the demon says, settling down beside
      you. "Now, let us talk of the dangers you face and the aid I can provide."'
    action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    audioDialogue:
      audioDialogueMixerGroups:
      - Time: 0.00000014885079
        MixerGroup: {fileID: 24300002, guid: 75eb9796b90238647ba4efa707e9793c, type: 2}
      - Time: 2.0463932
        MixerGroup: {fileID: 0}
      - Time: 5.3784466
        MixerGroup: {fileID: 24300002, guid: 75eb9796b90238647ba4efa707e9793c, type: 2}
      sectionalAudioClips:
      - audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0d64a824e0a5fa04db05a6cd4bdfcd52, type: 3}
        slider:
          MinLimit: 0
          MaxLimit: 1
          MinMaxValues: {x: 0.13836476, y: 1}
        time: 0
  - paragraph: It gestures to the bag of gold and treasures. "Within this bag lies
      an artifact of great power, one that can shield you from the evil lurking in
      the shadows. This talisman is imbued with an ancient magic, capable of turning
      the tide in your favor when all seems lost."
    action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    audioDialogue:
      audioDialogueMixerGroups:
      - Time: 3.0184681
        MixerGroup: {fileID: 24300002, guid: 75eb9796b90238647ba4efa707e9793c, type: 2}
      sectionalAudioClips:
      - audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9705382ffa8bfef4688abae99f6cfb8b, type: 3}
        slider:
          MinLimit: 0
          MaxLimit: 1
          MinMaxValues: {x: 0.02515728, y: 0.9937108}
        time: 0
  - paragraph: The demon's eyes lock onto yours, its grin never wavering. "But remember,
      such power comes with a price. Not every gift is free, and every boon carries
      its own burden. In accepting this, you may find yourself indebted to forces
      beyond your understanding."
    action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    audioDialogue:
      audioDialogueMixerGroups:
      - Time: 4.8299036
        MixerGroup: {fileID: 24300002, guid: 75eb9796b90238647ba4efa707e9793c, type: 2}
      sectionalAudioClips:
      - audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec028a9ef4df45744b2e8f4ddbc19c61, type: 3}
        slider:
          MinLimit: 0
          MaxLimit: 1
          MinMaxValues: {x: 0, y: 0.99371064}
        time: 0
  - paragraph: It leans back, watching your reaction carefully. "So, traveler, will
      you take this chance? Will you embrace the uncertainty and wield the power
      I offer, or will you face the perils of the road ahead on your own? The decision
      is yours, and it will shape the path you walk from this moment forward."
    action:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    audioDialogue:
      audioDialogueMixerGroups:
      - Time: 3.3909175
        MixerGroup: {fileID: 24300002, guid: 75eb9796b90238647ba4efa707e9793c, type: 2}
      sectionalAudioClips:
      - audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e8c1d61192d4948438150da3b6b4c169, type: 3}
        slider:
          MinLimit: 0
          MaxLimit: 1
          MinMaxValues: {x: 0.018867925, y: 0.9874213}
        time: 0
  promptResponses:
  - response: Accept the gift
    responseAction:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    nextPrompt: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6b9c22282e25a41418f6557058b42851, type: 2}
    nextPromptSetupSettings: 0
  - response: Refuse the gift
    responseAction:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    nextPrompt: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9b160dfbe6734f4ba971650e9bf1dc3, type: 2}
